SUMMARY:Wake Up and Sing! with Toowong State School Signing Choir
DESCRIPTION:Join the Toowong State School Signing Choir for a morning of si
 nging and learning some basic Auslan signs. The choir consists of Auslan (
 Australian Sign Language) students from Years 4–6 who are Deaf\, hard of
  hearing and hearing\, and will perform a selection of popular songs to br
 ighten your day.
